FFmpeg in TextMouth

This software uses libraries from the FFmpeg project under the LGPLv2.1.

TextMouth converts the audio of the formats macOS and iOS cannot read (Windows Media,
Matroska and WebM, AVI, Flash video, RealMedia, Musepack, and Speex) with FFmpeg's
libavformat, libavcodec, libswresample, and libavutil, linked statically, under the GNU
Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later (COPYING.LGPLv2.1 and LICENSE.md, beside
this file). No part of FFmpeg under the GPL is built: configure was not given --enable-gpl,
--enable-nonfree, or --enable-version3, and its summary says "License: LGPL version 2.1 or
later".

The release: FFmpeg 9.0.2, from https://ffmpeg.org/releases/ffmpeg-9.0.2.tar.xz
Its SHA-256: 8c3850283eb25fa026482078a04051e0be17347b09ef81a0849bec15a96e002e
It is signed by FFmpeg's release key, fingerprint FCF986EA15E6E293A5644F10B4322F04D67658D8.
When ffmpeg.org cannot be reached, the build takes FFmpeg's own mirror's archive of the tag n9.0.2
instead, from https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/archive/refs/tags/n9.0.2.tar.gz
Its SHA-256: 6e374ed621e48faa40639307dff48ba6fe574a509977956d2cce9669b7cc27e9
The two hold the same files, but for the release's VERSION file, which the tag's archive lacks, and
git's own files (.gitattributes and .gitignore files), which the tarball lacks.

TextMouth changes the release in one way: FFmpeg 9.0.2 with 5 upstream patches. Each is a commit
of FFmpeg's own development branch (https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commit/<commit>.patch), kept
unchanged in Scripts/vendor/ffmpeg/patches/<commit>.patch, and applied, in this order, to the
unpacked release by Scripts/vendor/ffmpeg/build.py before FFmpeg is built. Each fixes a CVE that the
National Vulnerability Database lists as open in 9.0.2; the patches are dropped when a release includes them.

CVE-2026-125104: 968e9e948ed8c9ba90dbc875e60b843c755cf4ba
    SHA-256 of the patch file: 6e3c7995b54e7e2de339943c742857fc86183780abff662001ab512dbfd57ff7
CVE-2026-125171: 5d59b7c45d7142bddd13ddc8891e72c5c7dc991b
    SHA-256 of the patch file: 11dcff0ca39589a65dab61f843b2505a9667a98e4cc1e59ae7000dd63dee7ec0
CVE-2026-125182: 7145d13201c9f9c5253f40295714faa4f4ada1a0
    SHA-256 of the patch file: 70e16648e035f26e6f940f088e313ea3d7027c22fd8801973ece85b8582f5d30
CVE-2026-125221: 972fe1ccd326538fe9a6b5d5094b7880b5443429
    SHA-256 of the patch file: c186bd41f88746877d429613fdbdafa37d18442953092b6af664db3e24b63031
CVE-2026-125224: 90f5e61a1da2dcc0050169af8ca593530f26071b
    SHA-256 of the patch file: aa28951df1335a46ed12f2324f0bd54a0bb530e1c07e7b62274b96e29079b0fe

TextMouth's own source, which is public under the MIT License, holds the script that
downloads, checks, and builds this release (Scripts/vendor/ffmpeg/build.py), so anyone can
build the app with a changed FFmpeg. The configure line of each platform, run by that
script, where tmff-cc is Xcode's clang given the platform's SDK:

The Mac (macOS 14.0, arm64):

configure --disable-everything --disable-autodetect --disable-network --disable-programs --disable-doc --disable-avdevice --disable-swscale --disable-avfilter --enable-static --disable-shared --disable-debug --enable-zlib '--cc=tmff-cc --target=arm64-apple-macos14.0' '--as=tmff-cc --target=arm64-apple-macos14.0' --enable-small --enable-demuxer=asf --enable-demuxer=matroska --enable-demuxer=flv --enable-demuxer=avi --enable-demuxer=rm --enable-demuxer=mpc --enable-demuxer=mpc8 --enable-demuxer=ogg --enable-decoder=wmav1 --enable-decoder=wmav2 --enable-decoder=wmapro --enable-decoder=wmalossless --enable-decoder=wmavoice --enable-decoder=speex --enable-decoder=mpc7 --enable-decoder=mpc8 --enable-decoder=cook --enable-decoder=sipr --enable-decoder=atrac3 --enable-decoder=ralf --enable-decoder=ra_144 --enable-decoder=ra_288 --enable-decoder=aac --enable-decoder=mp3float --enable-decoder=mp2float --enable-decoder=ac3 --enable-decoder=eac3 --enable-decoder=opus --enable-decoder=vorbis --enable-decoder=dca --enable-decoder=flac --enable-decoder=alac --enable-decoder=truehd --enable-decoder=mlp --enable-decoder=tta --enable-decoder=wavpack --enable-decoder=ape --enable-decoder=pcm_s16le --enable-decoder=pcm_s16be --enable-decoder=pcm_s24le --enable-decoder=pcm_s24be --enable-decoder=pcm_s32le --enable-decoder=pcm_s32be --enable-decoder=pcm_f32le --enable-decoder=pcm_f32be --enable-decoder=pcm_f64le --enable-decoder=pcm_f64be --enable-decoder=pcm_u8 --enable-decoder=pcm_s8 --enable-decoder=pcm_alaw --enable-decoder=pcm_mulaw --enable-decoder=adpcm_ms --enable-decoder=adpcm_ima_wav --enable-decoder=adpcm_swf --enable-decoder=nellymoser --enable-decoder=gsm_ms --enable-parser=aac --enable-parser=ac3 --enable-parser=cook --enable-parser=dca --enable-parser=flac --enable-parser=gsm --enable-parser=mlp --enable-parser=mpegaudio --enable-parser=opus --enable-parser=sipr --enable-parser=vorbis

The iPhone (iOS 26.0, arm64):

configure --disable-everything --disable-autodetect --disable-network --disable-programs --disable-doc --disable-avdevice --disable-swscale --disable-avfilter --enable-static --disable-shared --disable-debug --enable-zlib '--cc=tmff-cc --target=arm64-apple-ios26.0' '--as=tmff-cc --target=arm64-apple-ios26.0' --enable-cross-compile --target-os=darwin --arch=aarch64 --enable-small --enable-demuxer=asf --enable-demuxer=matroska --enable-demuxer=flv --enable-demuxer=avi --enable-demuxer=rm --enable-demuxer=mpc --enable-demuxer=mpc8 --enable-demuxer=ogg --enable-decoder=wmav1 --enable-decoder=wmav2 --enable-decoder=wmapro --enable-decoder=wmalossless --enable-decoder=wmavoice --enable-decoder=speex --enable-decoder=mpc7 --enable-decoder=mpc8 --enable-decoder=cook --enable-decoder=sipr --enable-decoder=atrac3 --enable-decoder=ralf --enable-decoder=ra_144 --enable-decoder=ra_288 --enable-decoder=aac --enable-decoder=mp3float --enable-decoder=mp2float --enable-decoder=ac3 --enable-decoder=eac3 --enable-decoder=opus --enable-decoder=vorbis --enable-decoder=dca --enable-decoder=flac --enable-decoder=alac --enable-decoder=truehd --enable-decoder=mlp --enable-decoder=tta --enable-decoder=wavpack --enable-decoder=ape --enable-decoder=pcm_s16le --enable-decoder=pcm_s16be --enable-decoder=pcm_s24le --enable-decoder=pcm_s24be --enable-decoder=pcm_s32le --enable-decoder=pcm_s32be --enable-decoder=pcm_f32le --enable-decoder=pcm_f32be --enable-decoder=pcm_f64le --enable-decoder=pcm_f64be --enable-decoder=pcm_u8 --enable-decoder=pcm_s8 --enable-decoder=pcm_alaw --enable-decoder=pcm_mulaw --enable-decoder=adpcm_ms --enable-decoder=adpcm_ima_wav --enable-decoder=adpcm_swf --enable-decoder=nellymoser --enable-decoder=gsm_ms --enable-parser=aac --enable-parser=ac3 --enable-parser=cook --enable-parser=dca --enable-parser=flac --enable-parser=gsm --enable-parser=mlp --enable-parser=mpegaudio --enable-parser=opus --enable-parser=sipr --enable-parser=vorbis

The iPhone simulator (iOS 26.0, arm64):

configure --disable-everything --disable-autodetect --disable-network --disable-programs --disable-doc --disable-avdevice --disable-swscale --disable-avfilter --enable-static --disable-shared --disable-debug --enable-zlib '--cc=tmff-cc --target=arm64-apple-ios26.0-simulator' '--as=tmff-cc --target=arm64-apple-ios26.0-simulator' --enable-cross-compile --target-os=darwin --arch=aarch64 --enable-small --enable-demuxer=asf --enable-demuxer=matroska --enable-demuxer=flv --enable-demuxer=avi --enable-demuxer=rm --enable-demuxer=mpc --enable-demuxer=mpc8 --enable-demuxer=ogg --enable-decoder=wmav1 --enable-decoder=wmav2 --enable-decoder=wmapro --enable-decoder=wmalossless --enable-decoder=wmavoice --enable-decoder=speex --enable-decoder=mpc7 --enable-decoder=mpc8 --enable-decoder=cook --enable-decoder=sipr --enable-decoder=atrac3 --enable-decoder=ralf --enable-decoder=ra_144 --enable-decoder=ra_288 --enable-decoder=aac --enable-decoder=mp3float --enable-decoder=mp2float --enable-decoder=ac3 --enable-decoder=eac3 --enable-decoder=opus --enable-decoder=vorbis --enable-decoder=dca --enable-decoder=flac --enable-decoder=alac --enable-decoder=truehd --enable-decoder=mlp --enable-decoder=tta --enable-decoder=wavpack --enable-decoder=ape --enable-decoder=pcm_s16le --enable-decoder=pcm_s16be --enable-decoder=pcm_s24le --enable-decoder=pcm_s24be --enable-decoder=pcm_s32le --enable-decoder=pcm_s32be --enable-decoder=pcm_f32le --enable-decoder=pcm_f32be --enable-decoder=pcm_f64le --enable-decoder=pcm_f64be --enable-decoder=pcm_u8 --enable-decoder=pcm_s8 --enable-decoder=pcm_alaw --enable-decoder=pcm_mulaw --enable-decoder=adpcm_ms --enable-decoder=adpcm_ima_wav --enable-decoder=adpcm_swf --enable-decoder=nellymoser --enable-decoder=gsm_ms --enable-parser=aac --enable-parser=ac3 --enable-parser=cook --enable-parser=dca --enable-parser=flac --enable-parser=gsm --enable-parser=mlp --enable-parser=mpegaudio --enable-parser=opus --enable-parser=sipr --enable-parser=vorbis
